                                                                             rdfs:label "interacts_with_an_exposure stressor_via" .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/exo#is_associated_with
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/exo#is_associated_with> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
